"Radhe Krishna Banarasi Chaat is one of the original slayers of Mumbai’s street food scene, tucked away in the inner lanes off Linking Road, Khar (West). Expect a true bang-for-your-buck Chole Bhature and lipsmacking, classic chaat. The Ragda Pattice, Pani Puri, Dahi Puri, and Sev Puri are all exceptional picks that never disappoint."🚦🙏🏽

